== Demographics ==

Original's population of 731,320 makes it the second-most populous ciutat in Sant Cristòfor. Its demographic profile differs significantly from the city-wide average: it has a higher proportion of Black Balboans (35.2% vs. 34.6% city-wide), reflecting the historic southern neighbourhoods, and a lower proportion of White Balboans (8.0% vs. 9.1%), who concentrate in [[Costa Nord (ciutat)|Costa Nord]] and [[Sant Miquel (ciutat)|Sant Miquel]]. The Zong (8.0%) and Nakamian (4.4%) communities are concentrated in the eastern barris and bay shore financial district.

